WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.125 --> 00:00:01.000
- Go long! 

00:00:01.041 --> 00:00:01.666
WAIT, STOP!

00:00:01.791 --> 00:00:03.416
- Don’t limit my route, Kirk! I mean, Josh!

00:00:03.583 --> 00:00:04.541
- We must never go there.

00:00:04.625 --> 00:00:07.833
That’s the New York section of Gridiron Heights.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:08.541
[Horn, honking]

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:09.833
- WOO! I ESCAPED!

00:00:09.958 --> 00:00:11.916
A YEAR-AND-A-HALF! MY MOST PATIENT RUN YET!

00:00:12.041 --> 00:00:13.583
Alright, I guess I'll go win a Super Bowl then.

00:00:16.333 --> 00:00:18.416
- Let’s get the ball back. We need to prove we can get a big win!

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:18.875
- Here?

00:00:18.958 --> 00:00:22.625
- Free comedy. Free comedy. Come just watch the Jets be the Jets.

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:26.000
- Hot dogs, I gotta get rid of these glory hogs. They have no place on a real team, OK?

00:00:26.458 --> 00:00:27.666
- Hey, I'm blockin' here!

00:00:27.833 --> 00:00:28.458
- Uncle Frank!

00:00:28.583 --> 00:00:32.375
- Back when I started, Times Square still had that big Toys R Us.

00:00:32.708 --> 00:00:34.000
- Hey, don’t you owe me something?

00:00:34.083 --> 00:00:36.250
- Yes, Judge. One. Two. 

00:00:36.291 --> 00:00:38.375
- LOOK! I’M LIKE VRABEL IF HE FOLLOWED THE SAFETY GUIDELINES!

00:00:38.833 --> 00:00:40.625
- JUDGE, I’VE GOT MY BUG EYES ON YOU. 

00:00:40.958 --> 00:00:42.541
THIS IS JETS TERRITORY.

00:00:42.666 --> 00:00:44.000
- [Together:] AHHHHHHHH!

00:00:44.083 --> 00:00:45.916
- We can bust out of this godforsaken town

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.708
Together we could net a third-round pick!

00:00:47.916 --> 00:00:48.958
- OH, SORRY YOUSE ALL.

00:00:49.166 --> 00:00:52.291
- Get out now while you can still…backup for an aging vet.

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:54.833
- DAMN YOU, NYC!

00:00:54.958 --> 00:00:56.416
- Technically, we play in Jersey.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.375
- Thank goodness we’re home safe. 

00:00:58.416 --> 00:00:58.791
- Uh Oh.

00:00:58.791 --> 00:00:59.875
- [Together:] OW, OW, OW, OW.

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:12.833
- I'm just so happy.

